.\" DSTerminal Manual
.TH DSTERMINAL 1 "August 2026" "4.0.0.113" "DSTerminal Manual"
.SH NAME
dsterminal \- Enterprise Security & Reconnaissance Suite
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dsterminal
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
DSTerminal is a comprehensive security and reconnaissance suite designed
for penetration testing, vulnerability assessment, and system hardening.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B hardening
Run System Hardening Dashboard
.TP
.B exploit
Run Exploit Vulnerability Scanner
.TP
.B recon
Run Network Reconnaissance Engine
.TP
.B recon <target>
Run Reconnaissance on specific target
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \--quick
Quick system hardening
.TP
.B \--full
Full system hardening
.TP
.B \--status
Show system status
.TP
.B \--help
Show help message
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B dsterminal hardening
Start hardening dashboard
.TP
.B dsterminal recon google.com
Run reconnaissance on google.com
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /etc/dsterminal/config.json
Configuration file
.TP
.B /var/lib/dsterminal/workspace/
Workspace directory
.SH AUTHOR
Stark Expo Tech Exchange <support@dsterminal.io>
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR nmap (1), whois (1), nslookup (1)
